{"title":"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/8/cd842e36ed64086a882c190267900ce65d1f7017.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/907e515c43197f174b604b7332f14b3f231d7ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DB}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70cabfec7d6a77caf8fa94bdaaf883751f489242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DP}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> trisect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c28b8d709d3b873ec6db017839b1520919db39db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />.  What is the perimeter of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68e5a266b8a03dd97e5f43003941f4fde50077f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BDP$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10ad0d6c91539b40c085057a166894ac1cede67f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,2)--(3.4,2)--(3.4,0)--(0,0)--cycle); draw((0,0)--(1.3,2)); draw((0,0)--(3.4,2)); dot((0,0)); dot((0,2)); dot((3.4,2)); dot((3.4,0)); dot((1.3,2)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,2),NW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(3.4,2),NE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(3.4,0),SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(1.3,2),N); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"165\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/9/9a95ba1fcb161dab2a31b605e15a6889d73f888f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2+\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2+2\\sqrt{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{3+3\\sqrt{5}}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2+\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"632\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f2d07bc097212bf747f3f762ed1cc6b8fcb6214.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,2)--(3.4,2)--(3.4,0)--(0,0)--cycle); draw((0,0)--(1.3,2)); draw((0,0)--(3.4,2)); dot((0,0)); dot((0,2)); dot((3.4,2)); dot((3.4,0)); dot((1.3,2)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,2),NW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(3.4,2),NE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(3.4,0),SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(1.3,2),N); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(0,1),W); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(1.7,1),SE); label(&quot;$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$&quot;,(0.65,2),N); label(&quot;$\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}$&quot;,(0.85,1),NW); label(&quot;$\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}$&quot;,(2.35,2),N); label(&quot;$\\sqrt{3}$&quot;,(1.7,0),S); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(3,1),W); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"185\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/8/cd842e36ed64086a882c190267900ce65d1f7017.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c28b8d709d3b873ec6db017839b1520919db39db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is trisected, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd12e7cc07bd11563140f8d02273dfcb12427a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADP= \\angle PDB= \\angle BDC=30^\\circ$\" width=\"267\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83b219aa1d23d5256d1873756cb0eb2240388a27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PD=\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"89\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/1301b8e8b40ec7441345bd766ecc97355adca5f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DB=2$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c83a8002caca93e160a4caf067e82acb6d5633b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP=\\sqrt{3}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"188\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>Adding, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01f9c115c6598651948ce0d49bf22e596b6b687e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }  2+\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"115\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>This is due to the fact that ABD and ABP are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> triangles\n</p><p>-Amon26\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After computing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/118622e6c13eed24c598c37ba580e4fdbbc0f2ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BP} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"43\" /> observe that triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/7/f472fc12f1c5ac19a4de3dd4d35d55f5f77840f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BPD$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is isosceles with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d3ec242efd13831d033560af16cd8d27106bf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DPB = \\angle BPD.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"146\" height=\"14\" /> Therefore, using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3f2ac1c49be0938e380fd8af9af03260d0b31e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120 - 30 - 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" /> triangle properties, we see that the perimeter is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c02a374a9f93d2360f9f2c4c4215e7a12db6c21a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2+ \\sqrt{3}) \\cdot \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }  2+\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"266\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p>~Sliced_Bread\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZUVMXRNBP2M\">https://youtu.be/ZUVMXRNBP2M</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wITXxUtZj3E?si=KuLEI9SeOFZTw05Y\">https://youtu.be/wITXxUtZj3E?si=KuLEI9SeOFZTw05Y</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 10\">2000 AMC 10</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017110721\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 222/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2290/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 124/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recur